---
title: Home
layout: base
description: "Jacob Beers builds software, from runtimes to production. Conference speaking, language engineering, developer tools, and consulting."
---
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <h1 id="intro-title">I build software, from runtimes to production.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Software engineer, technical leader, and conference speaker. I contribute to BoxLang, created MatchBox, and bring software into production across cloud and on-prem environments.</p>
    <div class="hero-links">
      <a class="text-link primary-link" href="{{ '/talks/' | url }}">Explore my talks <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a class="text-link secondary-link" href="{{ '/about/#work-with-me' | url }}">Work with me <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <img class="editorial-art hero-art" src="{{ '/images/editorial-orbit.webp' | url }}" alt="" width="1254" height="1254" fetchpriority="high">
</section>

<section class="page-section" id="conference-talks" aria-labelledby="speaking-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">01 / Speaking</p>
  <h2 id="speaking-title">Ideas worth sharing.</h2>
  <div class="featured-talks home-featured-talks">
    {% for talk in talks %}
    {% if loop.index <= 2 %}
    <article class="featured-talk">
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ talk.venue }} {{ talk.year }}</p>
      <h3><a href="{{ talk.url }}">{{ talk.title }}</a></h3>
      <a class="resource-link" href="{{ talk.url }}">Session details <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </article>
    {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <div class="section-links">
    <a class="text-link" href="{{ '/talks/' | url }}">All talks &amp; appearances <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    <a class="text-link" href="mailto:jacobtbeers@gmail.com?subject=Conference%20speaking">Invite me to speak <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="page-section" id="selected-work" aria-labelledby="work-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">02 / Selected work</p>
  <h2 id="work-title">From language runtimes to research infrastructure.</h2>
  {% include "selected-work.njk" %}
  <p class="section-note">Cloud and on-prem deployments. Kubernetes clusters. Technical leadership across the stack.</p>
  <a class="text-link" href="{{ '/about/' | url }}">More about my work <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
</section>

<section class="page-section" aria-labelledby="writing-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">03 / Writing</p><h2 id="writing-title">Notes from the workbench.</h2></div>
    <a class="text-link" href="{{ '/article/' | url }}">All writing <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
  </div>
  <ul class="link-list">
    {% for post in collections.article | reverse %}
    {% if post.data.selected %}
    <li><a href="{{ post.url | url }}">{{ post.data.title }} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></li>
    {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="page-section" aria-labelledby="experiments-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">04 / Experiments</p>
  <h2 id="experiments-title">A little room to play.</h2>
  <div class="experiment-list">
    <article><h3><a href="{{ '/pico-8/ufo.html' | url }}">UFO <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></h3><p>A PICO-8 game experiment.</p></article>
    <article><h3><a href="{{ '/projects/bayesian/' | url }}">Bayesian Analysis Helper <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></h3><p>Explore probabilities with interactive examples.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="contact-section" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
  <h2 id="contact-title">Let's build something worth sharing.</h2>
  <p>For speaking, employment, and consulting.</p>
  <a class="text-link" href="mailto:jacobtbeers@gmail.com">Get in touch <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
</section>
